<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Boumat earnings slump.</title>
<headline>Boumat earnings slump.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>15 months ended June 25 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)	   44	vs	104*</p>
<p>    Div (cts)			-	vs	 22</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	 7.11	vs    19.46</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    13.09	vs    48.25</p>
<p>    Tax			   6.21	vs    21.45</p>
<p>    Interest paid	    33.55	vs     8.96</p>
<p>    Turnover		2,374.54	vs 1,638.21</p>
<p>* 12 months to March 31 1995</p>
<p>Full name: Boumat Ltd</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	10.91	vs    10.85</p>
<p>NOTE - The board of directors has resolved that, due to the present high level of debt, a dividend will not be declared.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
